[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2572444838","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100642#issuecomment-2572444838","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100642","id":2572444838,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZVGSm","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-06T07:17:03Z","updated_at":"2025-01-06T07:17:03Z","body":"I do not see any difference between editor and runtime. Not sure if it's fully fixable, seems like two fonts are selected for different parts of text and neither have all required characters.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2572444838/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573389272","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100642#issuecomment-2573389272","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100642","id":2573389272,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZYs3Y","user":{"login":"zaevi","id":12966814,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTY2ODE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12966814?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi","html_url":"https://github.com/zaevi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-06T15:49:43Z","updated_at":"2025-01-06T15:49:43Z","body":"If set `Bidi > Language` to `zh_CN`, it also works as expected. So the issue may occur when falling back to default locale.\n\nTextServer uses `get_tool_locale()` to get the current locale. According to documentation, it should return the same value as `get_locale()` at runtime, but I found that it returned fixed value `en`: \n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/1aaf20b1f1f3ab59f04db74b166540327a3f1f90/core/string/translation_server.cpp#L491-L510\n\nThis led to it using fonts in different languages to shape texts.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573389272/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573413332","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100642#issuecomment-2573413332","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100642","id":2573413332,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZYyvU","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-06T16:02:05Z","updated_at":"2025-01-06T16:02:05Z","body":"> TextServer uses get_tool_locale() to get the current locale. According to documentation, it should return the same value as get_locale() at runtime, but I found that it returned fixed value en:\n\nThis is expected behavior, it should only return system locale if you have translation files for this locale, no translations included, always assumed to be English.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573413332/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573431351","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100642#issuecomment-2573431351","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100642","id":2573431351,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZY3I3","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-06T16:11:29Z","updated_at":"2025-01-06T16:11:29Z","body":"> If set Bidi > Language to zh_CN, it also works as expected. So the issue may occur when falling back to default locale.\n\nIt's likely that incorrect language is causing wrong font selection order (can happen for both system and embedded fonts). And if you have `zh_CN` set as editor locale, it likely the reason it's looking different in the editor, editor locale is incorrectly applied to the opened project (should use translation context).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573431351/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573468702","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100642#issuecomment-2573468702","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100642","id":2573468702,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZZAQe","user":{"login":"darksylinc","id":3395130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTUxMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3395130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc","html_url":"https://github.com/darksylinc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-06T16:31:33Z","updated_at":"2025-01-06T16:33:19Z","body":"Hi!\n\nI came here because I saw the PR. I have a couple questions:\n\n1. Why are no translations loaded?\n2. Is the game intended to be primarily written in Chinese for a chinese audience? (i.e. no english at all, or very little of it)\n3. Is the game in English with english as main but will use chinese characters inside?\n\nI'm trying to understand the context here.\n\nBecause it sounds the game is written mainly in chinese for a chinese audience, hence provides no translations, which causes Godot to assume english as fallback locale while trying to render chinese glyphs, and thus causing the shaping distortion.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573468702/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573475379","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100642#issuecomment-2573475379","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100642","id":2573475379,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZZB4z","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-06T16:35:11Z","updated_at":"2025-01-06T16:35:11Z","body":"We probably should have some way to force default single language without adding translations, since this is not an uncommon use case. But we definitely can't assume user system locale is supported by the project.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573475379/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573498830","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100642#issuecomment-2573498830","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100642","id":2573498830,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZZHnO","user":{"login":"zaevi","id":12966814,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTY2ODE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12966814?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi","html_url":"https://github.com/zaevi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-06T16:47:32Z","updated_at":"2025-01-06T16:47:32Z","body":"In cases where i18n is not required, we will develop projects directly in single language without using translations. In this case, it may not be appropriate for TextServer to get the current locale through translation context.\n\nLet TextServer use `get_locale()` to get current locale would be easier to solve this as https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101184#discussion_r1904370408 discussed.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573498830/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573512779","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100642#issuecomment-2573512779","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100642","id":2573512779,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZZLBL","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-06T16:54:43Z","updated_at":"2025-01-06T16:54:43Z","body":"> Let TextServer use get_locale() to get current locale would be easier to solve this as https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101184#discussion_r1904370408 discussed.\n\nThe better way is probably to set language in the controls using `TranslationDomain` (which uses `get_locale`), and avoid direct calls to `get_tool_locale` at all. This will require a bit more changes but should have better editor/project locale separation. I'll look a doing it tomorrow.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573512779/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573518233","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100642#issuecomment-2573518233","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100642","id":2573518233,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZZMWZ","user":{"login":"zaevi","id":12966814,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTY2ODE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12966814?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi","html_url":"https://github.com/zaevi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-06T16:57:42Z","updated_at":"2025-01-06T16:57:42Z","body":"@darksylinc This can happen in any project in non-English system and does not use translation.\n\nI've found some previous issues that may be related: #93211, #91470","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573518233/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2574878524","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100642#issuecomment-2574878524","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100642","id":2574878524,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZeYc8","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-07T10:04:56Z","updated_at":"2025-01-07T10:04:56Z","body":"> The better way is probably to set language in the controls using TranslationDomain (which uses get_locale), and avoid direct calls to get_tool_locale at all.\n\nActually, this should be already implemented in #97918","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2574878524/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]